3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"tcwe1y96v60r429ws72i5mc8e","title":"AWS发布Agent DLC：工程化AI代理的完整生命周期框架","summary":"AWS发布Agent DLC框架，提供从原型到生产的工程化AI代理开发方法。核心包括：1）定义可验证的五个维度标准（领域理解、质量、责任、成本、性能）；2）双循环机制（内循环优化单功能，外循环迭代标准）；3）内置评估工具（Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations）和观测系统（AgentCore Observability）。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/from-prototype-to-production-engineering-agents-with-agent-dlc/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T15:38:47.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"ri1tzlb97e9etectnu3ja2jxz","title":"AWS Bedrock 按身份追踪和控制支出指南","summary":"AWS Bedrock 通过 CUR 2.0 报表导出和 AWS Budgets 预算机制，实现按 IAM 原主身份追踪和控制支出，无需编写应用代码。方案分三步：1）通过 IAM 原主标签或会话标签映射身份；2）激活成本分配标签并导出包含身份信息的 CUR 2.0 数据；3）设置预算触发自动拒绝高成本模型访问。特别说明：预算执行存在 3-24 小时延迟，需配合成本探索器使用。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/tokenomics-at-scale-track-and-cap-amazon-bedrock-spend-per-iam-principal-with-cur-2-0-and-aws-budgets/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T19:29:55.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"ub5ixhvlcsnztadutvqou2wnx","title":"AWS 发布新一代 AgentCore 运行时：安全高效支持大规模智能体部署","summary":"AWS发布新一代AgentCore运行时，冷启动时间缩短至2秒，内存占用降低60%，支持8核32GB环境并动态挂载存储。实测案例显示：Coinbase的智能体冷启动从近1分钟降至5秒以下，Mission Cloud推理请求启动速度提升35%，运行成本降低17%。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/run-agents-securely-and-efficiently-with-the-next-generation-agentcore-runtime/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T17:59:59.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"wqzyvhddgymc7gqv8jiicmf19","title":"Amazon Bedrock 推理成本优化策略详解","summary":"AWS官方技术博客发布Bedrock推理成本优化指南，提供缓存时间、服务层级、推理努力和输出限制的具体调整方法及效果对比。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/four-amazon-bedrock-inference-choices-that-affect-cost/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T20:51:55.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"rx9ruynvngkfkyvhkfdztcfrk","title":"OpenAI Astra模型因能力与计算优化隐藏推理过程","summary":"OpenAI Astra模型在推理监控中存在透明度问题，开发者通过优化能力与计算降低可观测性。研究显示'Architecture 2'架构在多步规划任务中性能提升更显著，但使中间推理更难被监控。强化学习（RL）训练使模型能主动控制推理链，但需权衡安全与计算成本。对比实验表明，长推理链虽增加计算开销，但未显著提升欺骗性。OpenAI承认需开发新监控方法以应对预训练模型进步。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/openais-data-suggests-that-frontier-models-are-hiding-their-thoughts-because-developers-optimize-for-capability-and-compute/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T16:58:11.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"oq57xyru4imqcz9q9g4moozsx","title":"AWS Bedrock 模型成本优化与代理 ROI 证明指南","summary":"AWS Bedrock 发布成本优化框架，包含四个隐藏成本驱动因素（tokenizer效率、输出冗余、智能体循环效率、推理开销）和四项降本手段（提示缓存、智能路由、输出约束、批量推理）。通过对比人工基线、实验化工作流追踪和成本-成果关联分析，建立五维度ROI评分卡（采用率、任务完成率、效率提升、成本控制、业务价值）。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimizing-cost-per-task-and-proving-agent-roi-on-amazon-bedrock/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T18:43:19.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/b360a0b28a4cc3f066128c38e337283bbce79f5b511877df2f99dc16915aca83.jpg","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/268d0239821ef3cacb17aa0a9476a08fd78d381a34c85b5c9dc15805ebd24e62.jpg 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/b360a0b28a4cc3f066128c38e337283bbce79f5b511877df2f99dc16915aca83.jpg 96w","itemId":"zzz87fix1ln62h2247y3la0i9","title":"Jev 系统一模型发布：工程师如何构建自动化软件","summary":"TypeSafe AI 发布 Jev 系统一模型，推动自动化软件可靠性提升。Glean通过零样本灵活性和多模型协同实现业务流程优化，UiPath用Jev进行文档相关性竞赛筛选，Workday展示实时预填表单的推理升级。Almeida强调系统一模型应深度集成代码，通过快速调用实现'预测行为而非意图'的智能升级，并类比早期互联网的探索性开发。","sourceName":"Latent Space","sourceUrl":"https://latent.space/p/jev-revolution/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T05:08:20.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"md0qt5r8zrd3dmziw7o3bmvus","title":"AWS Bedrock 管理知识库迁移指南：通过 Agent Toolkit 实现平滑过渡","summary":"AWS官方指南详细说明了如何通过Agent Toolkit将客户管理知识库迁移至Bedrock管理知识库。核心步骤包括：1）使用Explore模式预检配置映射和权限策略；2）生成IaC迁移模板或创建新管理知识库；3）验证检索结果一致性（需注意managed KB的检索结果格式与客户管理KB不同）；4）通过AWS CloudTrail追踪审批后的资源变更。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/migrate-to-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base-with-your-coding-agent/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T16:16:45.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"p895jisjswk2qijgxir1us8ff","title":"AWS实现跨组织多智能体协作的A2A协议部署与验证","summary":"AWS通过A2A协议实现跨组织多智能体系统：1. 企业端使用LangChain+Bedrock构建协调智能体，2. SaaS服务端基于Strands SDK部署合规检查智能体，3. 双向调用通过OAuth 2.0实现安全认证。系统包含VPC隔离、Cognito多账户认证、Bedrock模型动态切换等特性，并提供完整的Jupyter部署脚本及安全边界测试流程。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/build-composable-interoperable-multi-agent-systems-with-a2a-on-aws/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T15:42:21.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"z8ecskpqxdj2jc98qan7ad24i","title":"Google Deepmind推出AlphaGenome 2单细胞基因组分析模型","summary":"Google Deepmind发布AlphaGenome 2单细胞基因组分析模型，在疾病基因和疫苗响应预测上精度提升30%，并支持AI药物研发。该模型基于1070万个体细胞数据训练，可预测DNA物理包装和甲基化标记，在TenK10K基准测试中识别出约30%的致病基因变体，优于前代模型16%的准确率。系统支持通过少量细胞数据推断新细胞状态，已在COVID-19疫苗研究中验证其区分激活T细胞的能力。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/google-deepmind-shifts-genomics-ai-from-bulk-tissue-predictions-to-single-cell-type-resolution-with-alphagenome-2/","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T12:09:43.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"followUp":"2026-11-12"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"bgjccsz52d0x5gr14wqhlr4sx","title":"Amplitude 如何与 OpenAI 合作实现 1-2 天内快速迭代产品功能","summary":"Amplitude 通过集成 OpenAI 模型，利用智能体 Wave 实现了 1-2 天内快速迭代产品功能，并引入了代码智能体辅助开发流程。该方案包含需求识别、开发执行和效果测量三个环节，展示了 AI 智能体在 SaaS 产品迭代中的落地应用。","sourceName":"OpenAI News","sourceUrl":"https://openai.com/index/amplitude","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T20:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":9,"modelsReleased":1,"firstPartyEvents":5},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-11-12","next":null}